  "_comment": [
    "The v2 evaluation query set: 200 queries stratified by intent.",
    "",
    "  navigational (50) — the user knows the name (or almost: typos,",
    "    stale owners, partial names). Success = the named repo on top.",
    "  category (75) — the user names a genre of software. Success = the",
    "    canonical members of that genre in the top results. The 50 canary",
    "    queries (see canary.json) are all here so they contribute to the",
    "    judged metrics too; canary recall is computed from canary.json's",
    "    hand labels, never from the judge.",
    "  task (75) — the user describes what they want to do in plain",
    "    English. The original strength of the dense lane.",
    "",
    "Relevance labels do NOT live here — they live in qrels.json, produced",
    "by the UMBRELA judge over pooled results (see eval/README.md). This",
    "file is only the queries. Append new queries rather than editing",
    "existing ones; metric history is only comparable on a fixed set.",
    "",
    "queries.json (the 5 original seeds) is unchanged and remains the",
    "default for `make eval`; this set is the decision-grade one."
  ],
